Description: Ocean PRoot Linux distribution and rootfs manager
 Manages Debian, Ubuntu, Alpine, Arch, Fedora, Rocky, AlmaLinux, openSUSE,
 Void, Kali, CentOS Stream, Devuan, and Gentoo userlands inside OceanStudio
 using an Ocean-owned PRoot workflow independent from proot-distro.
